# ACC-FR-GRN-01 · Galbanum Ivy Green v1.0

A layered green accord from volatile galbanum, leafy salicylate, wet stem, Verdox/Verdyl body and moss-vetiver shadow.

**Category:** Fresh & Musk  
**Recommended use:** 1–8% of perfume concentrate  
**Maturation:** 5–10 days  
**Monte Carlo pass:** 99.96%  
**Design score:** 99.75/100  
**Outcome:** `COMPUTATIONAL ACCORD DESIGN PASS`

